1
00:01:30,340 --> 00:01:33,578
=Against The Current=

2
00:01:33,579 --> 00:01:35,000
(Adapted from He Yanshan's novel,
Orchid Fragrance Fate)

3
00:01:35,180 --> 00:01:36,920
=Episode 32=
(This drama does not correspond)

4
00:01:36,930 --> 00:01:38,200
(to any real historical dynasty.)

5
00:01:38,210 --> 00:01:41,160
(The systems, culture, attire and other
dynastic elements have been adapted.)

6
00:01:41,870 --> 00:01:42,680
I know

7
00:01:42,870 --> 00:01:44,150
you surely can't accept

8
00:01:44,280 --> 00:01:46,560
the wife of the Lin family
writing plays for performers.

9
00:01:48,040 --> 00:01:49,120
If word gets out,

10
00:01:49,120 --> 00:01:50,640
it won't reflect well on the family.

11
00:01:50,870 --> 00:01:53,870
I might even be condemned
for corrupting public morals.

12
00:01:55,000 --> 00:01:56,640
But this is what I want to do.

13
00:01:57,200 --> 00:01:58,840
I decided on it before I married you.

14
00:01:59,950 --> 00:02:02,230
Even if you and the elders
of the Lin family disapprove,

15
00:02:02,790 --> 00:02:04,150
I'll still keep doing it.

16
00:02:05,480 --> 00:02:06,070
However,

17
00:02:06,590 --> 00:02:07,840
I'll use a pen name.

18
00:02:08,590 --> 00:02:11,150
Mister Lu and Furong will also
help keep my identity hidden.

19
00:02:11,680 --> 00:02:14,800
I won't let this damage
your reputation or the Lin family's.

20
00:02:51,560 --> 00:02:52,360
Well...

21
00:02:56,030 --> 00:02:57,150
What's the play called?

22
00:02:58,264 --> 00:03:00,088
The Tale of the Feathered Immortal.

23
00:03:01,750 --> 00:03:02,280
Is...

24
00:03:02,590 --> 00:03:03,430
Is it good?

25
00:03:05,000 --> 00:03:06,870
It should be quite good.

26
00:03:07,680 --> 00:03:10,560
Many women pool their money to rent out
a theater and watch it together.

27
00:03:11,680 --> 00:03:12,750
They cry as they watch.

28
00:03:13,240 --> 00:03:16,520
Some ladies even invite the troupe
to perform at their residences

29
00:03:16,584 --> 00:03:18,400
for their daughters
who are about to marry.

30
00:03:20,030 --> 00:03:20,870
What's it about?

31
00:03:23,840 --> 00:03:26,000
There's a girl named Tanniang

32
00:03:26,470 --> 00:03:28,870
who saves an eagle
caught in a hunter's net.

33
00:03:29,870 --> 00:03:31,470
The eagle gives her a feather.

34
00:03:32,590 --> 00:03:34,470
Whenever she holds
the feather over a flame,

35
00:03:35,190 --> 00:03:37,840
it causes her heart great pain,
but she can turn into a bird.

36
00:03:38,840 --> 00:03:40,240
She can only use it three times.

37
00:03:41,120 --> 00:03:42,470
If she uses it a fourth time,

38
00:03:43,280 --> 00:03:44,870
she'll remain a bird forever

39
00:03:45,176 --> 00:03:46,680
and can never become human again.

40
00:03:48,960 --> 00:03:51,800
(Tanniang thinks
being human is wonderful.)

41
00:03:53,470 --> 00:03:56,470
(Who would be foolish enough
to endure searing pain in their heart)

42
00:03:56,800 --> 00:03:58,870
(just to turn themselves into a bird?)

43
00:04:00,152 --> 00:04:01,430
(After Tanniang grows up,)

44
00:04:01,608 --> 00:04:03,280
(when a marriage is arranged for her,)

45
00:04:03,590 --> 00:04:06,030
(she can't understand
why she's the one getting married)

46
00:04:06,280 --> 00:04:09,280
(when she doesn't even know
what the man looks like.)

47
00:04:09,280 --> 00:04:10,280
Xiuwan.

48
00:04:11,750 --> 00:04:13,000
(Tanniang can't resist.)

49
00:04:13,150 --> 00:04:15,030
(She holds the feather over a flame.)

50
00:04:15,144 --> 00:04:16,630
(Enduring the pain in her heart,)

51
00:04:17,040 --> 00:04:19,750
(she turns into a lovely little thrush)

52
00:04:19,870 --> 00:04:21,016
(and goes to secretly see)

53
00:04:21,080 --> 00:04:23,830
(the man she's about
to spend her life with.)

54
00:04:24,070 --> 00:04:24,870
Mother.

55
00:04:27,950 --> 00:04:28,870
I've made

56
00:04:28,870 --> 00:04:30,190
your favorite pastries.

57
00:04:30,560 --> 00:04:32,510
Madam, push a little harder!

58
00:04:32,510 --> 00:04:34,630
- Madam, push!
- Madam!

59
00:04:34,870 --> 00:04:35,630
Push!

60
00:04:35,630 --> 00:04:36,510
Young Lady!

61
00:04:37,630 --> 00:04:39,390
Young Lady, hold on!

62
00:04:39,630 --> 00:04:40,600
Push! Push harder!

63
00:04:40,680 --> 00:04:44,040
(After marrying, Tanniang's baby is in
the wrong position during childbirth.)

64
00:04:44,040 --> 00:04:45,630
Push! Keep pushing!

65
00:04:45,920 --> 00:04:49,390
(She has no choice but to endure
the searing pain in her heart once more)

66
00:04:50,560 --> 00:04:52,040
(and turn into a swallow.)

67
00:04:52,600 --> 00:04:54,560
(She narrowly escapes death)

68
00:04:55,390 --> 00:04:57,040
(and finally gives birth to her child.)

69
00:05:01,870 --> 00:05:02,680
(Later,)

70
00:05:03,560 --> 00:05:05,040
(the family goes to the market.)

71
00:05:06,480 --> 00:05:07,680
(On their way home,)

72
00:05:08,040 --> 00:05:09,070
(they encounter bandits.)

73
00:05:12,056 --> 00:05:13,448
(To save her family,)

74
00:05:13,496 --> 00:05:15,950
(Tanniang endures the searing pain
in her heart once more)

75
00:05:16,160 --> 00:05:17,830
(and turns into a myna bird.)

76
00:05:19,360 --> 00:05:20,750
(She goes to summon the constables)

77
00:05:21,390 --> 00:05:24,040
(and saves the lives
of her husband and his parents.)

78
00:05:31,680 --> 00:05:34,480
(Tanniang decides
to throw the feather away)

79
00:05:34,830 --> 00:05:36,950
(and live a peaceful life from then on.)

80
00:05:38,510 --> 00:05:40,270
(She'll never turn into a bird again.)

81
00:05:44,040 --> 00:05:44,680
Tell me!

82
00:05:44,870 --> 00:05:45,800
Where did you hide

83
00:05:45,800 --> 00:05:46,830
all those valuable jewels?

84
00:05:49,430 --> 00:05:50,830
You won't tell me, will you?

85
00:05:50,870 --> 00:05:51,870
You still won't tell me?

86
00:05:51,870 --> 00:05:54,650
- Father, please stop hitting Mother!
- I'll beat you until you talk!

87
00:05:54,800 --> 00:05:55,750
Father!

88
00:05:56,510 --> 00:05:57,310
Father!

89
00:05:57,310 --> 00:06:00,510
(But her husband
and his parents bring constables...)

90
00:06:00,510 --> 00:06:01,270
Father!

91
00:06:01,360 --> 00:06:02,680
(To arrest her.)

92
00:06:03,160 --> 00:06:04,270
Shut your mouth!

93
00:06:04,680 --> 00:06:06,600
(They plan to burn her as a monster.)

94
00:06:06,648 --> 00:06:08,630
(Sun Baozhu, Lu Jian's mother,
First Madam of the Lu family)

95
00:06:08,630 --> 00:06:09,680
(Amid the flames,)

96
00:06:10,160 --> 00:06:11,720
(Tanniang turns into an eagle)

97
00:06:13,310 --> 00:06:14,430
(and flies away.)

98
00:06:39,070 --> 00:06:40,630
After Tanniang flies away,

99
00:06:40,830 --> 00:06:42,270
doesn't she miss her child?

100
00:06:43,270 --> 00:06:45,360
Do you think
she'll fly back to see her child?

101
00:06:46,680 --> 00:06:47,680
Of course she will.

102
00:06:50,360 --> 00:06:52,000
I hope she doesn't go back.

103
00:06:53,600 --> 00:06:55,120
But most women

104
00:06:55,192 --> 00:06:57,960
probably wouldn't be able to resist
going back to see their children.

105
00:06:59,688 --> 00:07:00,710
That's what leads to

106
00:07:00,720 --> 00:07:02,940
the opening scene
of The Tale of the Feathered Immortal.

107
00:07:02,950 --> 00:07:05,000
That eagle caught in the hunter's net...

108
00:07:07,190 --> 00:07:08,240
So

109
00:07:08,510 --> 00:07:09,600
that eagle

110
00:07:10,430 --> 00:07:11,870
was once a woman, too?

111
00:07:17,680 --> 00:07:20,190
Put the red dates on the left
and the longans on the right.

112
00:07:25,120 --> 00:07:25,920
Nanxing.

113
00:07:26,232 --> 00:07:27,720
The pattern on this vase is wrong.

114
00:07:28,040 --> 00:07:29,750
Use the pair with children at play.

115
00:07:29,800 --> 00:07:31,630
It symbolizes
many children and grandchildren.

116
00:07:31,950 --> 00:07:33,000
Yes, Madam.

117
00:07:35,870 --> 00:07:36,720
Xiuwan.

118
00:07:37,680 --> 00:07:39,560
These mung bean cakes are very cooling.

119
00:07:39,570 --> 00:07:42,632
A young lady like you should be careful,
or you'll have stomachaches later.

120
00:07:45,480 --> 00:07:46,510
Wait. Hold on.

121
00:07:47,270 --> 00:07:49,600
This double happiness character
is a little crooked.

122
00:07:50,160 --> 00:07:51,630
Take a closer look.

123
00:07:56,240 --> 00:07:58,070
My dear young lady,

124
00:07:59,800 --> 00:08:01,560
these red date cakes are too warming.

125
00:08:01,624 --> 00:08:03,944
It's already easy to get
a spring rash this time of year.

126
00:08:04,040 --> 00:08:06,600
If you don't watch what you eat,
your face might break out.

127
00:08:14,160 --> 00:08:16,240
Everything is either
too warming or too cooling.

128
00:08:17,270 --> 00:08:17,920
Yuejian.

129
00:08:18,168 --> 00:08:20,070
These dragon
and phoenix wedding candles...

130
00:08:20,630 --> 00:08:22,830
Why do they look different
in thickness to me?

131
00:08:24,160 --> 00:08:25,040
I'll get another one.

132
00:08:25,360 --> 00:08:25,920
Hurry.

133
00:08:26,480 --> 00:08:27,390
Second Madam.

134
00:08:32,480 --> 00:08:33,240
Aunt Lingxiao.

135
00:08:33,270 --> 00:08:35,030
You're just in time.

136
00:08:35,480 --> 00:08:37,030
I truly can't figure out

137
00:08:37,030 --> 00:08:38,840
what young ladies in the capital like.

138
00:08:39,030 --> 00:08:41,270
There's something
I need you to take a look at.

139
00:08:42,960 --> 00:08:43,320
This...

140
00:08:43,320 --> 00:08:44,670
Don't hit my mother!

141
00:08:44,750 --> 00:08:45,910
Don't hit my mother!

142
00:08:45,910 --> 00:08:46,670
This child...

143
00:08:46,670 --> 00:08:47,240
I...

144
00:08:47,240 --> 00:08:47,910
Yingzhi.

145
00:08:48,312 --> 00:08:49,320
Don't say such things.

146
00:08:51,600 --> 00:08:52,790
Mother, be gentle.

147
00:08:52,960 --> 00:08:54,360
You're hurting Xiulai.

148
00:08:54,600 --> 00:08:55,000
I...

149
00:08:55,670 --> 00:08:57,550
I barely used any force at all.

150
00:08:58,030 --> 00:08:59,750
How could it hurt this much?

151
00:09:01,550 --> 00:09:02,480
First Young Lady.

152
00:09:04,180 --> 00:09:07,220
(Jinrui, Lin Xiulai's first-class maid)

153
00:09:26,240 --> 00:09:28,080
I accidentally fell yesterday.

154
00:09:28,504 --> 00:09:30,270
It's not like I've never fallen before.

155
00:09:30,344 --> 00:09:32,472
That doesn't look like
an injury from a fall.

156
00:09:33,670 --> 00:09:35,240
It looks more like someone hit you.

157
00:09:35,390 --> 00:09:36,240
Xiulai...

158
00:09:40,480 --> 00:09:42,240
You really should have
been more careful.

159
00:09:42,440 --> 00:09:43,000
I have

160
00:09:43,240 --> 00:09:44,750
some excellent ointment for bruises.

161
00:09:44,776 --> 00:09:45,870
Apply it when you get home.

162
00:09:45,944 --> 00:09:47,030
You'll be fine once you do.

163
00:09:47,030 --> 00:09:47,840
No.

164
00:09:47,910 --> 00:09:48,720
No.

165
00:09:48,870 --> 00:09:49,510
No...

166
00:09:51,224 --> 00:09:53,380
There are some things
an unmarried young lady like you

167
00:09:53,416 --> 00:09:54,440
shouldn't get involved in.

168
00:09:54,440 --> 00:09:55,600
Mother, I...

169
00:09:55,624 --> 00:09:58,008
Do you want Old Master
to confine you again?

170
00:10:07,208 --> 00:10:09,320
Escort the Second Young Lady
back to her room to rest.

171
00:10:09,360 --> 00:10:10,480
Take good care of her.

172
00:10:20,960 --> 00:10:21,670
Yingzhi.

173
00:10:21,840 --> 00:10:23,360
I'll take you to feed the goldfish.

174
00:10:36,670 --> 00:10:37,630
Second Madam.

175
00:10:38,360 --> 00:10:39,870
Please, save the Young Lady.

176
00:10:40,080 --> 00:10:41,030
If this continues,

177
00:10:41,240 --> 00:10:43,120
her husband will beat her to death.

178
00:10:43,390 --> 00:10:45,030
Please save the Young Lady.

179
00:10:50,030 --> 00:10:50,840
Aunt Lingxiao.

180
00:10:53,240 --> 00:10:54,840
I want to separate from Lu Jian.

181
00:11:18,030 --> 00:11:20,150
Your husband is a refined scholar.

182
00:11:20,670 --> 00:11:22,320
Why would he ever hit you?

183
00:11:22,840 --> 00:11:24,480
Did you disobey your parents-in-law

184
00:11:24,960 --> 00:11:26,480
or do something wrong?

185
00:11:31,790 --> 00:11:33,200
My husband wants an official post.

186
00:11:34,000 --> 00:11:35,150
Jinqi told him to wait.

187
00:11:36,670 --> 00:11:38,270
But my husband grew impatient,

188
00:11:38,870 --> 00:11:40,320
so he wanted to take my dowry

189
00:11:40,670 --> 00:11:42,630
and use the money to secure connections.

190
00:11:43,000 --> 00:11:45,030
But over the years, he's already taken

191
00:11:45,030 --> 00:11:46,750
everything valuable from my dowry.

192
00:11:48,790 --> 00:11:50,750
He got angry and hit me again.

193
00:11:59,270 --> 00:12:00,960
You two are still young.

194
00:12:01,270 --> 00:12:02,480
After a few more years,

195
00:12:02,840 --> 00:12:05,030
once you've been married longer,
things will be fine.

196
00:12:05,030 --> 00:12:06,030
Second Madam.

197
00:12:06,670 --> 00:12:07,360
Besides,

198
00:12:08,550 --> 00:12:10,480
family troubles
shouldn't be made public.

199
00:12:13,030 --> 00:12:14,080
We women

200
00:12:14,390 --> 00:12:17,510
must stand by the men we marry.

201
00:12:18,000 --> 00:12:20,000
Now that you're a wife of the Lu family,

202
00:12:20,080 --> 00:12:23,030
no matter how many faults
Lu Jian may have,

203
00:12:24,200 --> 00:12:25,870
he's still your husband

204
00:12:26,840 --> 00:12:28,480
and the father of your children.

205
00:12:59,200 --> 00:13:00,200
Aunt Lingxiao...

206
00:13:13,630 --> 00:13:15,360
(Jinqiao is still rather playful.)

207
00:13:15,550 --> 00:13:19,200
(I just want to go
to the capital with him)

208
00:13:19,288 --> 00:13:21,240
(and make sure the wedding
is properly arranged)

209
00:13:21,270 --> 00:13:23,750
(so both the Lin and Cheng families
can hold their heads high.)

210
00:13:28,750 --> 00:13:31,270
(Xiuwan truly knows she was wrong.)

211
00:13:32,030 --> 00:13:33,480
(If this drags on any longer,)

212
00:13:34,030 --> 00:13:36,030
(she really won't
be able to find a match.)

213
00:13:45,270 --> 00:13:46,360
I know.

214
00:13:49,720 --> 00:13:51,360
I know you've suffered.

215
00:13:53,670 --> 00:13:54,750
But right now,

216
00:13:55,910 --> 00:13:57,670
your third brother
is about to get married,

217
00:13:57,944 --> 00:14:00,270
and your second sister
still needs to find a match.

218
00:14:00,670 --> 00:14:03,360
Even if you won't consider
your younger siblings' marriages,

219
00:14:04,360 --> 00:14:06,870
you should at least
think of your own children.

220
00:14:08,750 --> 00:14:10,270
If you really separate from him,

221
00:14:11,360 --> 00:14:12,910
what will happen to your two children?

222
00:14:21,840 --> 00:14:23,600
For women like us,

223
00:14:25,864 --> 00:14:27,592
our marriages
are arranged by our parents

224
00:14:28,270 --> 00:14:29,480
and negotiated by matchmakers.

225
00:14:32,080 --> 00:14:34,240
How many of us
ever marry the man we truly want?

226
00:14:37,000 --> 00:14:39,150
Don't we all just endure it day by day?

227
00:14:46,440 --> 00:14:47,670
Look no further

228
00:14:48,670 --> 00:14:50,000
than your own mother.

229
00:14:50,024 --> 00:14:51,840
Back then, while she
was pregnant with a son,

230
00:14:52,150 --> 00:14:53,960
she was so distressed
that she lost the baby.

231
00:14:54,510 --> 00:14:56,584
Didn't she still cry
until she had no tears left

232
00:14:57,080 --> 00:14:58,440
and somehow endure it all?

233
00:15:55,670 --> 00:15:56,550
We can't

234
00:15:57,960 --> 00:16:00,670
let your elder brother
or younger siblings know about this.

235
00:16:00,960 --> 00:16:02,240
After some time has passed,

236
00:16:02,240 --> 00:16:04,080
I'll talk to Jinqi.

237
00:16:05,270 --> 00:16:07,080
I'll ask him
to find your husband a good post.

238
00:16:08,080 --> 00:16:09,840
Once your husband gets what he wants,

239
00:16:11,670 --> 00:16:13,080
everything will be fine.

240
00:16:15,480 --> 00:16:16,550
I understand.

241
00:16:19,840 --> 00:16:21,080
Just endure it a little longer.

242
00:16:23,750 --> 00:16:24,960
Once the children are older,

243
00:16:25,390 --> 00:16:26,550
everything will be all right.

244
00:16:28,320 --> 00:16:29,120
All right.

245
00:16:47,750 --> 00:16:48,600
Lanxiang.

246
00:16:49,910 --> 00:16:50,600
Lanxiang.

247
00:16:52,200 --> 00:16:53,080
It's me.

248
00:16:54,030 --> 00:16:55,030
Xiuwan?

249
00:17:06,350 --> 00:17:07,440
You can go now.

250
00:17:36,720 --> 00:17:38,550
I was young and foolish before

251
00:17:38,680 --> 00:17:40,110
and often offended you.

252
00:17:40,920 --> 00:17:42,200
I've changed now.

253
00:17:42,720 --> 00:17:44,240
I hope you'll be generous enough

254
00:17:44,680 --> 00:17:46,310
to forgive
my recklessness and ignorance.

255
00:18:00,408 --> 00:18:02,070
Is there something you need from me?

256
00:18:03,270 --> 00:18:05,000
I've thought it over and over,

257
00:18:05,144 --> 00:18:06,952
and you're the only one
I can ask for help.

258
00:18:07,960 --> 00:18:08,960
In this family,

259
00:18:09,160 --> 00:18:11,400
you're the only one
who's both intelligent and capable,

260
00:18:11,400 --> 00:18:12,640
as well as strong and decisive.

261
00:18:14,270 --> 00:18:15,070
What is it?

262
00:18:15,912 --> 00:18:17,192
Our eldest sister's husband...

263
00:18:21,030 --> 00:18:23,310
That brute Lu Jian
has been beating Xiulai.

264
00:18:23,550 --> 00:18:24,960
Not just once or twice.

265
00:18:25,070 --> 00:18:26,550
He's beaten her countless times.

266
00:18:27,110 --> 00:18:29,160
He's also spent all her dowry

267
00:18:29,640 --> 00:18:31,240
and even tore up the dowry list.

268
00:18:33,640 --> 00:18:35,070
How did you find out?

269
00:18:36,070 --> 00:18:37,550
Mother tried to keep it from me.

270
00:18:38,030 --> 00:18:39,720
I sent Yinxian to talk to Jinrui.

271
00:18:39,832 --> 00:18:41,720
Jinrui broke down
and told her everything.

272
00:18:46,030 --> 00:18:46,880
This is something

273
00:18:47,030 --> 00:18:49,640
the family elders
should discuss with the Lu family.

274
00:18:50,270 --> 00:18:51,400
What did Aunt Lingxiao say?

275
00:18:52,880 --> 00:18:55,720
Mother is afraid it'll affect
Jinqiao's marriage and mine,

276
00:18:55,848 --> 00:18:57,240
so she told Xiulai to endure it.

277
00:18:58,030 --> 00:18:59,270
But Jinrui said

278
00:18:59,440 --> 00:19:01,720
that brute thinks Xiulai
has no one to stand up for her,

279
00:19:01,752 --> 00:19:03,496
so he's beating her
more and more severely.

280
00:19:03,790 --> 00:19:06,720
If she keeps enduring it,
it'll cost her life.

281
00:19:08,830 --> 00:19:09,550
I'd rather

282
00:19:09,550 --> 00:19:11,240
never marry for the rest of my life

283
00:19:11,680 --> 00:19:14,240
than let Xiulai suffer
at that brute's hands any longer.

284
00:19:23,680 --> 00:19:25,310
Since Aunt Lingxiao refuses to step in,

285
00:19:25,750 --> 00:19:28,070
and the eldest brother
is like a father,

286
00:19:28,480 --> 00:19:30,000
only Jinqi can decide what to do.

287
00:19:32,590 --> 00:19:34,240
Strictly speaking, as a junior,

288
00:19:34,880 --> 00:19:36,440
I shouldn't be saying this.

289
00:19:38,550 --> 00:19:41,880
When Uncle Changzheng was young, he
fancied himself quite the ladies' man.

290
00:19:42,400 --> 00:19:44,270
Back then, Old Madam ran the household.

291
00:19:44,720 --> 00:19:47,350
The woman who gave birth
to Xiulai was very calculating.

292
00:19:47,880 --> 00:19:49,400
She won Uncle Changzheng's favor

293
00:19:49,550 --> 00:19:51,864
and also charmed Old Madam
into thinking highly of her,

294
00:19:52,440 --> 00:19:54,240
causing all kinds of trouble.

295
00:19:54,920 --> 00:19:57,030
Aunt Shunhua was so distressed
that she miscarried

296
00:19:57,590 --> 00:19:59,350
and nearly died along with the baby.

297
00:20:00,440 --> 00:20:01,830
Jinqi was only eight years old,

298
00:20:01,960 --> 00:20:03,240
yet he picked up a wooden staff

299
00:20:03,250 --> 00:20:05,030
and went after Uncle Changzheng
and that woman.

300
00:20:05,030 --> 00:20:05,990
I'll beat you to death!

301
00:20:06,120 --> 00:20:07,440
Someone!

302
00:20:07,830 --> 00:20:10,400
Lin Jinqi, how dare you
strike your father? You unfilial son!

303
00:20:10,400 --> 00:20:11,240
I'll beat you to death!

304
00:20:11,240 --> 00:20:12,680
(Qiao Hongdou, Lin Xiulai's birth mother)
Someone!

305
00:20:12,830 --> 00:20:15,640
- I'll beat you to death!
- Someone! This is outrageous!

306
00:20:15,750 --> 00:20:16,590
What are you doing?

307
00:20:16,808 --> 00:20:18,728
- I'll beat you to death!
- You unfilial son!

308
00:20:18,830 --> 00:20:19,880
You unfilial son!

309
00:20:22,270 --> 00:20:23,270
I'll beat you to death!

310
00:20:23,400 --> 00:20:24,550
I'll beat you to death!

311
00:20:24,590 --> 00:20:25,750
I'll beat you to death!

312
00:20:26,070 --> 00:20:27,480
I'm bleeding!

313
00:20:27,590 --> 00:20:28,790
I'll beat you to death!

314
00:20:28,830 --> 00:20:29,750
I'll beat you to death!

315
00:20:29,750 --> 00:20:31,200
Lin Jinqi!

316
00:20:32,160 --> 00:20:33,750
His hand slipped,

317
00:20:34,350 --> 00:20:36,680
and he accidentally
injured Uncle Changzheng.

318
00:20:39,070 --> 00:20:40,550
His hand really did slip.

319
00:20:47,720 --> 00:20:48,880
What happened after that?

320
00:20:49,830 --> 00:20:51,680
After such a serious incident
in the family,

321
00:20:52,070 --> 00:20:55,440
Old Master rushed back
to Jinling from the capital.

322
00:20:55,720 --> 00:20:57,928
Some were beaten,
and some were sold off.

323
00:20:58,008 --> 00:21:00,400
He stripped Old Madam
of her authority over the household

324
00:21:00,640 --> 00:21:02,160
and put Aunt Shunhua in charge.

325
00:21:02,680 --> 00:21:04,590
Then he took Jinqi under his wing

326
00:21:04,720 --> 00:21:05,830
and taught him personally.

327
00:21:08,030 --> 00:21:09,030
Do you think

328
00:21:09,440 --> 00:21:11,640
your brother
won't intervene in Xiulai's situation?

329
00:21:12,440 --> 00:21:13,440
No.

330
00:21:14,110 --> 00:21:16,830
Xiulai didn't do
any of those bad things.

331
00:21:17,160 --> 00:21:18,720
She's a good person.

332
00:21:19,070 --> 00:21:21,110
Jinqi knows right from wrong.

333
00:21:22,400 --> 00:21:23,070
It's just...

334
00:21:29,440 --> 00:21:30,720
I was thinking

335
00:21:31,110 --> 00:21:32,830
that brute Lu Jian is very calculating.

336
00:21:32,904 --> 00:21:35,070
He always hits her where
no one can see the injuries.

337
00:21:35,200 --> 00:21:37,030
It would be hard
for Jinqi to learn the truth.

338
00:21:40,000 --> 00:21:40,880
Lanxiang.

339
00:21:42,030 --> 00:21:44,000
I'm still being punished

340
00:21:44,160 --> 00:21:45,440
and watched very closely.

341
00:21:46,880 --> 00:21:48,680
Please think of a way

342
00:21:49,310 --> 00:21:50,400
to save Xiulai.

343
00:21:56,790 --> 00:21:57,550
But I...

344
00:21:58,584 --> 00:22:00,504
only recently married into the family.

345
00:22:03,200 --> 00:22:05,070
Xiulai is truly suffering.

346
00:22:06,590 --> 00:22:07,920
If we don't help her,

347
00:22:08,680 --> 00:22:10,480
she really has no one else to rely on.

348
00:22:11,590 --> 00:22:13,110
Yingzhi is only five,

349
00:22:14,070 --> 00:22:15,960
and that brute even hits her.

350
00:22:19,790 --> 00:22:20,750
Lanxiang...

351
00:22:46,920 --> 00:22:47,750
What are you doing?

352
00:22:48,400 --> 00:22:49,920
Who do you people think you are?

353
00:22:50,160 --> 00:22:51,000
How dare you hit me?

354
00:22:51,160 --> 00:22:52,350
Do you know who I am?

355
00:22:52,440 --> 00:22:52,960
Young Master!

356
00:22:54,350 --> 00:22:55,720
Please spare me!

357
00:22:57,400 --> 00:22:58,030
Let go!

358
00:22:58,072 --> 00:22:58,824
You're too useless

359
00:22:58,872 --> 00:23:01,480
to get an official post
without relying on a woman,

360
00:23:01,680 --> 00:23:02,550
and you even beat her.

361
00:23:02,680 --> 00:23:05,144
A worthless man like you
who shamelessly lives off a woman!

362
00:23:05,224 --> 00:23:06,550
We'll beat you every time

363
00:23:06,550 --> 00:23:07,440
we see you.

364
00:23:09,200 --> 00:23:11,270
How do you know about my family affairs?

365
00:23:11,400 --> 00:23:12,480
Who sent you?

366
00:23:15,480 --> 00:23:16,070
Young Master!

367
00:23:16,070 --> 00:23:16,550
Let's go.

368
00:23:16,550 --> 00:23:16,750
Go!

369
00:23:19,070 --> 00:23:19,880
Young Master!

370
00:23:25,790 --> 00:23:26,510
Young Master!

371
00:23:28,790 --> 00:23:29,640
Easy.

372
00:23:32,030 --> 00:23:33,350
It hurts!

373
00:23:34,240 --> 00:23:35,070
Are you all right?

374
00:23:37,160 --> 00:23:38,270
Lin Jinqi.

375
00:23:38,440 --> 00:23:41,480
You'll pay dearly for this!

376
00:23:43,350 --> 00:23:44,480
He's been beaten so badly.

377
00:23:44,550 --> 00:23:45,880
What if he never recovers?

378
00:23:46,776 --> 00:23:48,070
Will he still be able to walk?

379
00:23:48,240 --> 00:23:49,200
Lin Jinqi!

380
00:23:49,590 --> 00:23:52,240
Look what you've done to my son!

381
00:23:52,776 --> 00:23:54,056
I'm still a Seventh-Rank

382
00:23:54,104 --> 00:23:56,520
Director of the Construction Office,
Ministry of Works.

383
00:23:56,568 --> 00:23:59,200
Don't think that just because
you're an Assistant Commander

384
00:23:59,200 --> 00:24:01,920
you can disregard
the law and attack people at will.

385
00:24:01,976 --> 00:24:03,400
(Lu Ju, Seventh-Rank)
This is the capital!

386
00:24:03,480 --> 00:24:04,830
(Director of the Construction Office, Ministry of Works)
The law still applies here!

387
00:24:05,200 --> 00:24:05,680
Exactly!

388
00:24:05,680 --> 00:24:05,880
Yes!

389
00:24:05,880 --> 00:24:06,880
(Lu Family Relatives)
This is the capital!

390
00:24:06,960 --> 00:24:08,160
Right under the Emperor's nose!

391
00:24:08,160 --> 00:24:08,960
You broke his legs!

392
00:24:08,960 --> 00:24:09,960
Look what you've done to his legs!

393
00:24:09,960 --> 00:24:11,160
I truly know nothing about this.

394
00:24:11,200 --> 00:24:13,340
Uncle, I'm afraid there must
be some misunderstanding.

395
00:24:13,350 --> 00:24:14,110
Misunderstanding?

396
00:24:14,350 --> 00:24:16,680
Look! You broke my son's legs,

397
00:24:16,728 --> 00:24:18,550
and you still call it
a misunderstanding?

398
00:24:18,590 --> 00:24:20,790
If you can't give the Lu family

399
00:24:20,790 --> 00:24:21,880
an explanation today,

400
00:24:22,200 --> 00:24:24,270
even if it costs me my life,

401
00:24:24,720 --> 00:24:27,640
I'll seek justice
before the Emperor himself.

402
00:24:27,640 --> 00:24:30,160
- Yes! We'll seek justice!
- Justice!

403
00:24:30,160 --> 00:24:31,200
Why would I

404
00:24:32,056 --> 00:24:34,600
send men to beat
my brother-in-law for no reason?

405
00:24:36,240 --> 00:24:36,920
Father.

406
00:24:37,128 --> 00:24:38,270
My chest hurts so much.

407
00:24:38,270 --> 00:24:39,000
Son!

408
00:24:39,070 --> 00:24:41,240
I'm afraid I don't have long to live.

409
00:24:41,464 --> 00:24:42,280
Son!

410
00:24:42,312 --> 00:24:42,920
Young Master!

411
00:24:42,920 --> 00:24:44,000
He can barely breathe!

412
00:24:44,000 --> 00:24:44,590
Young Master!

413
00:24:44,750 --> 00:24:45,640
Lin Jinqi!

414
00:24:46,270 --> 00:24:48,830
Even if my son disciplined his wife,

415
00:24:49,270 --> 00:24:51,270
he still knew his limits,
like any good carpenter

416
00:24:51,830 --> 00:24:53,070
knows his measurements!

417
00:24:53,480 --> 00:24:55,720
How could you be so ruthless

418
00:24:55,790 --> 00:24:57,880
and have him beaten nearly to death?

419
00:25:04,790 --> 00:25:05,400
Jian!

420
00:25:05,440 --> 00:25:06,510
Young Master!

421
00:25:06,510 --> 00:25:07,960
He can barely breathe!

422
00:25:07,960 --> 00:25:08,790
This is outrageous!

423
00:25:08,830 --> 00:25:10,110
A carpenter beating his wife?

424
00:25:10,550 --> 00:25:11,110
Young Master.

425
00:25:11,720 --> 00:25:12,720
He knows how far to go?

426
00:25:16,480 --> 00:25:19,070
Uncle, you truly are a Director
of the Construction Office.

427
00:25:19,920 --> 00:25:21,270
A proper scholar indeed.

428
00:25:21,832 --> 00:25:23,400
Even your every word is well crafted.

429
00:25:24,920 --> 00:25:26,830
What... What do you mean?

430
00:25:28,070 --> 00:25:29,400
Uncle, I'd like to ask you

431
00:25:29,736 --> 00:25:31,736
what exactly you mean by all this today.

432
00:25:32,680 --> 00:25:34,640
It's normal for family members

433
00:25:35,200 --> 00:25:36,440
to have the occasional quarrel.

434
00:25:37,030 --> 00:25:39,310
As long as you
can find my son a good post,

435
00:25:39,440 --> 00:25:40,880
we'll let this matter go.

436
00:25:40,880 --> 00:25:41,720
- Yes.
- Yes.

437
00:25:41,720 --> 00:25:43,680
Just find him a good post,
and we'll let this go.

438
00:25:43,720 --> 00:25:45,070
You make a good point, Uncle.

439
00:25:46,920 --> 00:25:49,590
Why doesn't he
join the Shenji Battalion first

440
00:25:49,640 --> 00:25:51,830
as a squad commander
and train for a couple of years?

441
00:25:52,680 --> 00:25:53,400
Then perhaps

442
00:25:54,510 --> 00:25:55,920
he can enter the Ministry of War.

443
00:25:56,590 --> 00:25:59,160
That does make some sense.

444
00:26:00,880 --> 00:26:01,480
However,

445
00:26:02,680 --> 00:26:04,590
if he wants to join
the Shenji Battalion,

446
00:26:05,440 --> 00:26:07,440
he'll have to follow its rules.

447
00:26:12,480 --> 00:26:13,440
What rules?

448
00:26:16,640 --> 00:26:17,640
His wrists

449
00:26:18,550 --> 00:26:19,270
need to be strong.

450
00:26:21,550 --> 00:26:22,070
Stop!

451
00:26:22,070 --> 00:26:22,750
It's broken!

452
00:26:23,480 --> 00:26:24,310
It's broken!

453
00:26:24,310 --> 00:26:25,590
It hurts!

454
00:26:25,590 --> 00:26:26,270
And his back

455
00:26:27,200 --> 00:26:28,480
needs to be straight.

456
00:26:30,270 --> 00:26:31,960
You... Why are you hitting him?

457
00:26:36,424 --> 00:26:37,672
- Jian!
- Young Master!

458
00:26:38,920 --> 00:26:39,440
No!

459
00:26:39,750 --> 00:26:40,400
No!

460
00:26:41,880 --> 00:26:43,590
No! I'm not joining
the Shenji Battalion!

461
00:26:43,590 --> 00:26:44,110
Young Master!

462
00:26:44,344 --> 00:26:46,230
I'm not joining
the Shenji Battalion! I'm not!

463
00:26:46,240 --> 00:26:47,070
Move! Out of the way!

464
00:26:47,270 --> 00:26:47,920
Son!

465
00:26:48,000 --> 00:26:49,350
You... You've gone too far!

466
00:26:51,070 --> 00:26:51,640
Young Master!

467
00:26:52,328 --> 00:26:53,656
Wait for me, Young Master!

468
00:26:54,830 --> 00:26:55,790
Quick, carry it away.

469
00:26:57,176 --> 00:26:58,750
Why... why are they carrying it away?

470
00:26:58,750 --> 00:26:59,070
I...

471
00:26:59,680 --> 00:27:00,510
This...

472
00:27:00,830 --> 00:27:02,240
Since when

473
00:27:02,830 --> 00:27:04,880
did the Young Master's fists
become a miracle cure?

474
00:27:05,160 --> 00:27:06,480
Just two punches,

475
00:27:07,110 --> 00:27:09,510
and First Son-in-Law's legs
aren't broken anymore,

476
00:27:09,960 --> 00:27:11,680
his chest doesn't hurt anymore,

477
00:27:12,270 --> 00:27:14,680
and he runs faster than a rabbit.

478
00:27:15,510 --> 00:27:17,510
A cure made especially
for the shameless.

479
00:27:18,240 --> 00:27:18,880
You...

480
00:27:19,110 --> 00:27:19,750
You...

481
00:27:19,960 --> 00:27:21,440
Let's go!

482
00:27:22,110 --> 00:27:22,640
All of you...

483
00:27:24,720 --> 00:27:25,510
Lin Jinqi.

484
00:27:26,160 --> 00:27:27,790
My son's injuries may not be serious,

485
00:27:28,160 --> 00:27:30,240
but you did hire men to assault him.

486
00:27:30,830 --> 00:27:31,680
Just you wait.

487
00:27:31,912 --> 00:27:33,976
I'm going to report you
to the Ministry of Justice!

488
00:27:34,110 --> 00:27:36,030
I'm going to report you!

489
00:27:36,680 --> 00:27:37,160
You...

490
00:27:37,750 --> 00:27:40,200
I refuse to believe
no one can deal with you!

491
00:27:40,350 --> 00:27:41,550
Just you wait!

492
00:27:51,030 --> 00:27:53,310
Who was it that secretly
had First Son-in-Law beaten?

493
00:27:53,830 --> 00:27:55,480
How dare they make you take the blame?

494
00:28:07,920 --> 00:28:09,270
Other than your Young Madam,

495
00:28:10,200 --> 00:28:11,830
who else would dare make me

496
00:28:12,070 --> 00:28:13,440
take the blame?

497
00:28:25,320 --> 00:28:27,336
My lady fought violence with violence.

498
00:28:27,512 --> 00:28:29,080
That was certainly swift and decisive.

499
00:28:30,920 --> 00:28:32,030
Now that it's come to this,

500
00:28:33,030 --> 00:28:34,350
what do you plan to do?

501
00:28:36,000 --> 00:28:37,070
From the look of things,

502
00:28:37,680 --> 00:28:39,270
you're clearly planning to bring Xiulai

503
00:28:39,640 --> 00:28:40,790
back from the Lu family.

504
00:28:41,160 --> 00:28:42,550
But will the Lu family agree?

505
00:28:43,240 --> 00:28:44,240
Will they let her go?

506
00:28:49,350 --> 00:28:51,030
Of course the Lu family
won't let her go.

507
00:28:51,510 --> 00:28:52,400
They won't agree.

508
00:28:54,400 --> 00:28:55,720
As Director Lu said,

509
00:28:56,104 --> 00:28:57,830
this is right under the Emperor's nose,

510
00:28:58,136 --> 00:28:59,680
where laws and decrees must be obeyed.

511
00:29:00,200 --> 00:29:01,944
No matter
how well Jiugao and I can fight,

512
00:29:02,200 --> 00:29:03,720
we can't openly

513
00:29:03,720 --> 00:29:05,640
barge into a court official's
inner residence

514
00:29:05,830 --> 00:29:07,310
and take away their daughter-in-law.

515
00:29:10,070 --> 00:29:10,790
My lady,

516
00:29:11,310 --> 00:29:12,270
what do you suggest?

517
00:29:15,960 --> 00:29:19,350
As long as you keep Director Lu and
the men of the outer residence occupied,

518
00:29:20,240 --> 00:29:22,030
I'll find a way into the inner residence

519
00:29:22,440 --> 00:29:23,440
to visit Xiulai.

520
00:29:32,350 --> 00:29:33,030
My lady,

521
00:29:33,590 --> 00:29:34,790
since you already have a plan,

522
00:29:35,880 --> 00:29:37,200
there's no time like the present.

523
00:29:38,920 --> 00:29:39,440
Let's go.

524
00:29:40,830 --> 00:29:43,400
We'll bring the Young Lady
back from the Lu family.

525
00:29:55,110 --> 00:29:57,240
Jinqi is going to bring Xiulai home?

526
00:30:02,480 --> 00:30:04,000
Xiulai is coming home!

527
00:30:04,960 --> 00:30:06,440
Xiulai is coming home!

528
00:30:11,440 --> 00:30:12,400
I'll blow on it.

529
00:30:12,590 --> 00:30:13,440
I'll blow on it.

530
00:30:14,200 --> 00:30:16,200
I'll blow on it for you, Mother.

531
00:30:16,640 --> 00:30:17,720
It won't hurt anymore.

532
00:30:18,270 --> 00:30:19,310
It won't hurt anymore.

533
00:30:35,200 --> 00:30:36,400
Yingzhi is still hungry.

534
00:30:36,750 --> 00:30:38,200
Take Yingzhi to eat first.

535
00:30:38,376 --> 00:30:39,160
I'll do it myself.

536
00:30:40,550 --> 00:30:41,270
All right.

537
00:30:41,576 --> 00:30:43,944
I'll bring the Young Lady
back after she's eaten.

538
00:30:49,680 --> 00:30:51,200
Let's go, Yingzhi.

539
00:31:44,400 --> 00:31:45,920
(It's my fault for being so helpless.)

540
00:31:48,310 --> 00:31:51,000
(From now on, you won't have
to live in fear with me anymore.)

541
00:31:52,020 --> 00:31:53,980
(Arsenic)

542
00:32:03,440 --> 00:32:04,270
What are you doing?

543
00:32:14,270 --> 00:32:15,110
What?

544
00:32:15,220 --> 00:32:17,060
(Arsenic)

545
00:32:21,310 --> 00:32:21,960
Water!

546
00:32:22,440 --> 00:32:23,070
Water!

547
00:32:24,070 --> 00:32:24,720
Water!

548
00:32:43,160 --> 00:32:43,880
Xiulai.

549
00:32:44,000 --> 00:32:45,270
We're here to take you home.

550
00:33:08,270 --> 00:33:09,070
It's all right now.

551
00:33:09,720 --> 00:33:11,000
We're taking you home right now.

552
00:33:11,270 --> 00:33:12,640
Don't let them leave the Lu family!

553
00:33:16,400 --> 00:33:17,510
What do we do, Lanxiang?

554
00:33:17,830 --> 00:33:18,960
Take good care of Xiulai.

555
00:33:19,310 --> 00:33:20,590
I'll deal with the Lu family.

556
00:33:21,200 --> 00:33:21,680
All right.

557
00:33:22,440 --> 00:33:22,920
Let's go.

558
00:33:26,600 --> 00:33:28,070
Don't let them leave the Lu family!

559
00:33:28,070 --> 00:33:29,700
- They're inside!
- They're right inside!

560
00:33:29,750 --> 00:33:30,550
Stop them!

561
00:33:30,830 --> 00:33:31,920
Don't let them get away!

562
00:33:31,920 --> 00:33:33,640
We have to teach them a lesson!

563
00:33:35,880 --> 00:33:36,720
They can't leave!

564
00:33:36,792 --> 00:33:38,990
How dare they bully the Lu family!
Don't let them leave!

565
00:33:40,000 --> 00:33:41,200
No one is leaving!

566
00:33:42,480 --> 00:33:44,830
Didn't you send away
the maid and your daughter

567
00:33:44,830 --> 00:33:46,350
because you wanted to kill yourself?

568
00:33:46,590 --> 00:33:47,480
And yet

569
00:33:47,880 --> 00:33:49,640
you're still perfectly alive.

570
00:33:52,070 --> 00:33:54,270
We barged in here
in a moment of desperation.

571
00:33:54,400 --> 00:33:55,640
That was our fault.

572
00:33:56,920 --> 00:33:59,880
You think you can threaten
the Lu family with your death?

573
00:33:59,960 --> 00:34:00,880
Dream on!

574
00:34:01,750 --> 00:34:03,310
My son already told me

575
00:34:03,496 --> 00:34:05,070
that under the laws of our dynasty,

576
00:34:05,170 --> 00:34:07,610
if a wife or concubine takes
her own life after being beaten

577
00:34:07,620 --> 00:34:10,190
or berated by her husband,
the husband bears no responsibility.

578
00:34:12,440 --> 00:34:15,070
I'm telling you, today,

579
00:34:15,190 --> 00:34:17,280
even though Lin isn't dead,

580
00:34:17,280 --> 00:34:18,632
even if she were, the Lu family

581
00:34:18,648 --> 00:34:21,150
would still be in the right
if this went before the authorities.

582
00:34:22,030 --> 00:34:24,920
Lin is a daughter-in-law
of the Lu family.

583
00:34:24,960 --> 00:34:26,510
Without our permission,

584
00:34:26,510 --> 00:34:28,320
she won't take
a single step out of here.

585
00:34:28,320 --> 00:34:31,550
- She can't leave the Lu family!
- Don't even think about leaving!

586
00:34:33,320 --> 00:34:34,110
Blood!

587
00:34:42,070 --> 00:34:42,800
She's bleeding!

588
00:34:42,880 --> 00:34:43,880
She's bleeding!

589
00:34:44,400 --> 00:34:45,190
Xiulai!

590
00:34:47,590 --> 00:34:48,510
Xiulai!

591
00:34:49,190 --> 00:34:50,230
Xiulai!

592
00:34:50,880 --> 00:34:52,630
Don't scare me!

593
00:34:53,360 --> 00:34:55,920
Xiulai!

594
00:34:55,960 --> 00:34:57,810
She could die!
What are you standing there for?

595
00:34:57,820 --> 00:34:59,580
Hurry and take her
to an imperial physician!

596
00:34:59,590 --> 00:35:01,070
Yuchan, go find Nanke and Jiugao.

597
00:35:01,070 --> 00:35:04,030
Get the carriage
and find an imperial physician! Hurry!

598
00:35:04,110 --> 00:35:05,150
Xiulai!

599
00:35:05,920 --> 00:35:06,960
Xiulai!

600
00:35:10,480 --> 00:35:12,320
Old Madam.
She isn't going to die, is she?

601
00:35:12,456 --> 00:35:13,950
Why would she do something so foolish?

602
00:35:13,960 --> 00:35:15,070
She isn't going to die, is she?

603
00:35:15,070 --> 00:35:16,510
What do we do?

604
00:35:16,510 --> 00:35:17,630
Old Madam, what do we do?

605
00:35:17,630 --> 00:35:19,150
What do we do?

606
00:35:19,230 --> 00:35:21,880
Old Madam, say something!

607
00:35:22,230 --> 00:35:23,400
Yes, tell us what to do.

608
00:35:23,920 --> 00:35:24,400
Well...

609
00:35:25,000 --> 00:35:26,000
Where is Lin?

610
00:35:26,510 --> 00:35:27,670
The Lin family took her away.

611
00:35:27,710 --> 00:35:29,550
How could you let
the Lin family take her?

612
00:35:29,920 --> 00:35:32,670
I was afraid she'd die here
if I tried to stop them.

613
00:35:33,030 --> 00:35:35,880
Didn't you say you knew
how far to go when you hit her?

614
00:35:35,880 --> 00:35:37,960
How did you beat Lin
until she lost consciousness?

615
00:35:38,070 --> 00:35:39,280
Her chest was covered in blood.

616
00:35:39,550 --> 00:35:41,320
She looked like she was about to die.

617
00:35:41,400 --> 00:35:42,150
Impossible.

618
00:35:43,550 --> 00:35:44,760
She must be pretending.

619
00:35:45,070 --> 00:35:46,630
I saw it with my own eyes.

620
00:35:46,760 --> 00:35:48,920
The blood slowly seeped out.

621
00:35:48,920 --> 00:35:49,800
Lin's sister

622
00:35:49,800 --> 00:35:52,232
was wailing as if she were at a funeral.

623
00:35:52,328 --> 00:35:53,440
We saw it with our own eyes.

624
00:35:53,440 --> 00:35:55,070
It's true. There was so much blood.

625
00:35:58,440 --> 00:35:59,760
What are we going to do?

626
00:36:17,280 --> 00:36:18,710
Judging from her pulse,

627
00:36:18,800 --> 00:36:20,880
it's just chronic liver qi stagnation

628
00:36:20,880 --> 00:36:22,280
and emotional distress

629
00:36:22,800 --> 00:36:25,000
that have weakened
her spleen and stomach,

630
00:36:25,070 --> 00:36:27,190
leaving her deficient in qi and blood.

631
00:36:27,416 --> 00:36:29,400
(Imperial Physician Yao)
Fortunately, she's still young.

632
00:36:29,400 --> 00:36:30,400
(Eighth-Rank,
from the Imperial Medical Service)

633
00:36:30,400 --> 00:36:32,710
With proper care for two or three years,

634
00:36:33,670 --> 00:36:34,880
she'll recover.

635
00:36:35,320 --> 00:36:36,920
Her life is not in danger.

636
00:36:37,510 --> 00:36:38,840
Her life isn't in danger?

637
00:36:39,190 --> 00:36:40,590
When Xiulai came back,

638
00:36:40,840 --> 00:36:42,440
her chest was covered in blood.

639
00:36:45,480 --> 00:36:47,150
We changed her clothes and examined her

640
00:36:47,440 --> 00:36:50,110
and found
many bruises and swollen areas,

641
00:36:50,400 --> 00:36:51,760
as well as some broken skin.

642
00:36:52,000 --> 00:36:54,070
But none of that could have
caused so much bleeding.

643
00:36:54,152 --> 00:36:56,540
Could it be that she wasn't bleeding
from an external injury,

644
00:36:56,552 --> 00:36:59,064
but coughed up blood because
her internal organs were injured?

645
00:37:00,150 --> 00:37:01,840
Yes, she coughed up blood.

646
00:37:01,928 --> 00:37:03,630
I was supporting
the Young Lady at the time

647
00:37:03,710 --> 00:37:04,840
when I heard her cough

648
00:37:05,000 --> 00:37:06,440
and saw blood all over her chest.

649
00:37:15,920 --> 00:37:18,760
At present,
her life is indeed not in danger.

650
00:37:18,760 --> 00:37:20,630
She merely coughed up
some stagnant blood.

651
00:37:20,920 --> 00:37:22,030
If you're still worried,

652
00:37:22,104 --> 00:37:23,880
I'll come back
in two days to check on her.

653
00:37:25,070 --> 00:37:26,840
The First Young Lady said her arm hurt.

654
00:37:27,112 --> 00:37:29,670
I learned a little about setting bones
when I was in Jinling,

655
00:37:30,000 --> 00:37:30,710
so I felt her arm.

656
00:37:31,070 --> 00:37:32,030
It was indeed broken.

657
00:37:33,000 --> 00:37:34,920
I was anxious and couldn't wait for you,

658
00:37:34,960 --> 00:37:36,760
so I set it for her.

659
00:37:36,824 --> 00:37:38,936
Please take a look,
Imperial Physician Yao.

660
00:37:45,000 --> 00:37:46,710
Absolutely not!

661
00:37:46,776 --> 00:37:47,688
This is outrageous!

662
00:37:48,440 --> 00:37:50,400
How could a woman's body
be examined so casually?

663
00:37:58,550 --> 00:37:59,510
Imperial Physician Yao,

664
00:38:00,960 --> 00:38:02,360
please sit down and explain.

665
00:38:05,950 --> 00:38:08,540
Assistant Commander Lin obtained
an imperial order for me to come,

666
00:38:08,550 --> 00:38:10,168
so naturally I'll do everything I can.

667
00:38:10,440 --> 00:38:12,550
Madam Lin, I need
to write up the medical record,

668
00:38:12,550 --> 00:38:14,510
so I need to ask you
a few more questions.

669
00:38:15,800 --> 00:38:16,590
Please.

670
00:38:17,480 --> 00:38:19,440
What did you find

671
00:38:19,510 --> 00:38:20,710
when you examined her?

672
00:38:21,920 --> 00:38:24,760
I found bruising and swelling

673
00:38:25,440 --> 00:38:26,880
three finger-widths below the elbow.

674
00:38:27,630 --> 00:38:30,630
I supported her elbow
and wrist and moved them gently.

675
00:38:31,190 --> 00:38:32,190
Even while unconscious,

676
00:38:32,510 --> 00:38:33,480
the First Young Lady

677
00:38:33,510 --> 00:38:35,360
showed signs of pain.

678
00:38:35,800 --> 00:38:38,630
Was there anything unusual
around the swollen bone?

679
00:38:38,880 --> 00:38:40,000
Was anything protruding?

680
00:38:41,000 --> 00:38:42,070
The shape looked normal.

681
00:38:42,960 --> 00:38:45,550
But there seemed to be a grating sound.

682
00:38:48,000 --> 00:38:50,280
It seems her arm is fractured.

683
00:38:52,960 --> 00:38:54,840
Fortunately, there's no deformity,

684
00:38:54,888 --> 00:38:56,400
so the bone doesn't need to be reset.

685
00:38:56,400 --> 00:38:58,550
It only needs
to be secured with a splint.

686
00:38:58,920 --> 00:39:00,880
Madam Lin handled it properly.

687
00:39:01,110 --> 00:39:02,000
She just needs to rest.

688
00:39:04,070 --> 00:39:05,230
I never imagined

689
00:39:05,760 --> 00:39:08,480
that her husband would be so brutal.

690
00:39:16,510 --> 00:39:19,000
Here's the prescription.
Have her take it for three days.

691
00:39:20,440 --> 00:39:21,280
I'll take my leave.

692
00:39:21,280 --> 00:39:22,440
Thank you, Imperial Physician.

693
00:39:36,230 --> 00:39:37,400
What a terrible mess.

694
00:39:56,960 --> 00:39:58,320
Jinqi! Jinlan!

695
00:40:00,550 --> 00:40:01,440
Jinqi. Jinlan.

696
00:40:01,592 --> 00:40:04,808
Didn't you hear the imperial physician
say that Xiulai's arm was broken?

697
00:40:06,150 --> 00:40:07,480
That brute Lu Jian!

698
00:40:07,880 --> 00:40:09,280
I'll go break his arm right now!

699
00:40:12,150 --> 00:40:14,000
Didn't Jinqi
already break one of his arms?

700
00:40:19,150 --> 00:40:20,960
Then I'll break his other arm

701
00:40:21,030 --> 00:40:22,590
so he can never bully Xiulai again.

702
00:40:23,360 --> 00:40:24,070
Come back.

703
00:40:31,840 --> 00:40:33,280
You're getting married tomorrow.

704
00:40:34,264 --> 00:40:34,960
Behave yourself.

705
00:40:36,440 --> 00:40:37,576
Mother kept this from me,

706
00:40:38,110 --> 00:40:39,550
and now even you say that, Jinqi.

707
00:40:40,550 --> 00:40:42,590
If we don't give Lu Jian
a beating he'll remember

708
00:40:42,800 --> 00:40:43,960
and teach him a lesson,

709
00:40:44,190 --> 00:40:46,190
he'll keep beating Xiulai in the future.

710
00:40:46,400 --> 00:40:47,320
Tomorrow,

711
00:40:47,416 --> 00:40:49,656
just take your wife
back to Jinling without worrying.

712
00:40:51,112 --> 00:40:52,552
There won't be a next time.

713
00:40:54,000 --> 00:40:54,840
What do you mean?

714
00:40:56,440 --> 00:40:58,110
Jinqi wants Xiulai to separate from him.

715
00:40:59,190 --> 00:41:00,320
That's what I want, too.

716
00:41:01,840 --> 00:41:02,840
Separate?

717
00:41:04,150 --> 00:41:06,230
Right! Why didn't I think of that?

718
00:41:06,400 --> 00:41:07,630
She can leave that brute.

719
00:41:07,710 --> 00:41:08,510
I agree!

720
00:41:10,360 --> 00:41:11,510
I don't!

721
00:41:23,992 --> 00:41:24,792
Jinqi,

722
00:41:25,360 --> 00:41:27,800
right now, it's not just Xiuwan
who hasn't found a match yet.

723
00:41:28,030 --> 00:41:29,000
There's also Xiushu.

724
00:41:29,320 --> 00:41:31,960
Once the new year passes,
she'll soon come of age.

725
00:41:32,400 --> 00:41:33,630
As the saying goes,

726
00:41:33,960 --> 00:41:36,550
a married daughter
is like water poured away.

727
00:41:36,712 --> 00:41:39,030
If she separates from her husband
over a little hardship,

728
00:41:39,230 --> 00:41:42,480
who will dare marry a daughter
of the Lin family in the future?

729
00:41:43,960 --> 00:41:46,280
A married daughter
is like water poured away.

730
00:41:47,160 --> 00:41:49,360
Mother, are you in such
a hurry to find me a husband

731
00:41:49,710 --> 00:41:51,920
because you want
to pour me away like water?

732
00:41:52,630 --> 00:41:55,030
No.

733
00:41:55,030 --> 00:41:56,960
If I'm mistreated
by my husband's family one day,

734
00:41:57,440 --> 00:41:59,400
I can only suffer
in silence and endure it,

735
00:41:59,448 --> 00:42:01,330
and never come home
to ask my family for help?

736
00:42:02,110 --> 00:42:03,800
That's not what I meant.

737
00:42:07,110 --> 00:42:08,360
My dear young lady.

738
00:42:08,510 --> 00:42:10,190
I didn't mean it that way.

739
00:42:11,150 --> 00:42:12,480
You're my precious girl.

740
00:42:14,360 --> 00:42:16,150
If anyone ever dares mistreat you,

741
00:42:16,320 --> 00:42:17,360
your brothers and I

742
00:42:17,480 --> 00:42:19,190
will never let him get away with it!

743
00:42:23,670 --> 00:42:24,110
I...

744
00:42:34,710 --> 00:42:35,880
Take your hand off.

745
00:42:37,840 --> 00:42:38,590
Take it off.

746
00:42:38,590 --> 00:42:39,320
Take it off!

747
00:42:42,960 --> 00:42:43,670
You...

748
00:42:48,230 --> 00:42:49,630
You're all making trouble for me!

749
00:42:54,840 --> 00:42:55,630
Mother.

750
00:42:58,590 --> 00:43:01,030
Yinxian found this in Xiulai's room.

751
00:43:01,030 --> 00:43:04,380
(Arsenic)

752
00:43:05,060 --> 00:43:07,420
=Against the Current=
(Next Episode's Preview)

753
00:43:08,400 --> 00:43:11,230
Marriage is the foundation
of human relations.

754
00:43:11,576 --> 00:43:13,816
First comes the duty
between husband and wife,

755
00:43:13,820 --> 00:43:15,800
and then the affection
between parent and child.

756
00:43:16,550 --> 00:43:19,190
Since Lu Jian refuses to separate,

757
00:43:19,480 --> 00:43:22,190
Lin shall be returned
to the Lu family today

758
00:43:22,550 --> 00:43:24,670
and remain a wife of the Lu family.

759
00:43:33,100 --> 00:43:36,220
(Justice and Impartiality)

760
00:43:47,590 --> 00:43:48,480
Lin.

761
00:43:50,440 --> 00:43:52,590
As long as you live,
you belong to the Lu family.

762
00:43:53,960 --> 00:43:56,230
Even in death, you'll still
belong to the Lu family.

763
00:44:12,580 --> 00:44:16,700
♪Spring slips from the
branches once more♪

764
00:44:19,540 --> 00:44:24,060
♪Flowers bloom unseen,
as they have before♪

765
00:44:25,340 --> 00:44:29,260
♪All the joys and sorrows come and go♪

766
00:44:29,940 --> 00:44:32,700
♪While loss leaves winter in the heart♪

767
00:44:33,420 --> 00:44:35,740
♪Though all the world may fade♪

768
00:44:35,740 --> 00:44:38,820
♪Time rolls on as
countless lives rush by♪

769
00:44:40,340 --> 00:44:44,580
♪Night winds wander
through the halls of long ago♪

770
00:44:47,500 --> 00:44:51,660
♪No page could hold the
longing words can never show♪

771
00:44:53,460 --> 00:44:57,020
♪Every joy and sorrow
in this fleeting life♪

772
00:44:57,020 --> 00:45:00,580
♪Fades into the past
as new wounds rise♪

773
00:45:01,380 --> 00:45:07,060
♪While whispers of perfume
linger beneath the eaves♪

774
00:45:07,420 --> 00:45:11,740
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

775
00:45:12,100 --> 00:45:15,060
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

776
00:45:15,060 --> 00:45:18,820
♪Let love fall to pieces,
let old anger burn away♪

777
00:45:18,820 --> 00:45:21,700
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

778
00:45:21,700 --> 00:45:25,780
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

779
00:45:25,780 --> 00:45:29,140
♪And silver moonlight to
guide me through the night♪

780
00:45:29,140 --> 00:45:32,900
♪Let beginnings fade
as endings come to call♪

781
00:45:32,900 --> 00:45:36,900
♪From this endless dream,
there's no return at all♪

782
00:45:37,660 --> 00:45:41,820
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

783
00:45:41,820 --> 00:45:45,260
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

784
00:45:45,260 --> 00:45:48,900
♪Let love fall to pieces,
let old anger burn away♪

785
00:45:48,900 --> 00:45:51,780
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

786
00:45:51,780 --> 00:45:55,860
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

787
00:45:55,860 --> 00:45:59,220
♪And silver moonlight to
guide me through the night♪

788
00:45:59,220 --> 00:46:02,860
♪Let beginnings fade
as endings come to call♪

789
00:46:02,860 --> 00:46:10,660
♪From this endless dream,
there's no return at all♪

